            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f2" n="47" xml:id="d29-f2-content">
                <p>For instruction No. 135, Mar. 2, 1928, to the Minister in Greece, see <ref
                        target="#pg19">p. 19</ref>; the draft treaty is not printed.</p>
            </note>
